878390073776245, "coordinate": [207, 899, 630, 946], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[207.0, 899.0], [630.0, 899.0], [630.0, 946.0], [207.0, 946.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.763043999671936, "coordinate": [476, 1085, 929, 1378], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[476.0, 1085.0], [929.0, 1085.0], [929.0, 1378.0], [476.0, 1378.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）\n\n五级【4~5分】：彼此尊重、彼此独立、没有束缚和包袱，各自活好自己阳光的生命。（自由）\n\n- 本条释义：父母与子女之间是平等的人格和独立自由的个体，彼此毫无束缚地去过自己的生活，社会的个体属性大于家庭的情感属性。\n\n符合的行为：\n\n1、享受自己独立和喜欢的生活，不依赖子女\n\n2、合理科学地安排好自己生活，不让子女操心\n\n3、生病了不傍子女照顾自己，不给子女添麻烦\n\n4、能够安排好自己的养老，请保姆照顾自己或找自己中意的养老院\n\n5、能够安排好自己的后事，乐观地面对疾病或死亡\n\n6、能够引导子女正确面对自己年迈疾病或死亡，不让他们沉浸在悲痛中，乐观阳光地对待\n\n[72]\n\n## 考评奖励标准——理财\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_476_1085_929_1378.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"38%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_476_1085_929_1378.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//a82044c1-6ce4-45e5-abae-27238820650e/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_476_1085_929_1378.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A16%3A21Z%2F-1%2F%2F7e62e70add0bd3aef6e6181540ff7d42fb034e4b7770095632d6c0dd7d40ce79"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//a82044c1-6ce4-45e5-abae-27238820650e/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A16%3A21Z%2F-1%2F%2F4192f7279d7e902217100ad108fe49541b3d39ad9954098400e25d44042305d9"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//a82044c1-6ce4-45e5-abae-27238820650e/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A16%3A21Z%2F-1%2F%2F945f3e2798bc53d3eff8a521c962f06e0986ad79ba920282f0d62067a7218c0b"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "prepr